{
  "name": "ReviewPilot Tool - SonarQube Search Issues",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ReviewPilot Tool - SonarQube Search Issues (Fase 7)\n- **Finalidade:** subworkflow opcional somente leitura exposto ao `Review Agent` via `Call n8n Workflow Tool` (`sonarqube_search_issues_tool`).\n- **Servidor MCP:** `http://sonarqube-mcp:8080/mcp` na rede interna `reviewpilot-net` via `HTTP Streamable` (`httpStreamable`).\n- **Ferramenta MCP:** `search_sonar_issues_in_projects`.\n- **Resiliência (SonarQube Opcional):** se `projectKey` estiver vazio ou se o container `sonarqube-mcp` estiver desligado, retorna `status: \"UNAVAILABLE_OPTIONAL\"` sem interromper a revisão do Pull Request.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 660
      },
      "id": "d7000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "SonarQube Tool Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "workflowInputs",
        "workflowInputs": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "projectKey",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "pageIndex",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "d7000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "When Executed by Another Workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        200,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-project-key",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.projectKey || '').trim() }}",
              "rightValue": "^[A-Za-z0-9_.:-]+$",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "regex"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d7000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Validate Sonar Project Key",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        460,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable",
        "endpointUrl": "http://sonarqube-mcp:8080/mcp",
        "authentication": "bearerAuth",
        "tool": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "search_sonar_issues_in_projects"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={\n  \"projects\": [{{ JSON.stringify($json.projectKey) }}],\n  \"projectKeys\": [{{ JSON.stringify($json.projectKey) }}],\n  \"pageIndex\": {{ Math.max(Number($json.pageIndex || 1), 1) }}\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "d7000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "SonarQube MCP - search_sonar_issues_in_projects",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        740,
        240
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "credentials": {
        "httpBearerAuth": {
          "id": "CREDENTIAL_ID_SONARQUBE_MCP_BEARER",
          "name": "ReviewPilot SonarQube MCP Read-Only"
        }
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Queries SonarQube MCP Server on internal Docker network via Streamable HTTP."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "out-status",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "SUCCESS",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-server",
              "name": "mcpServer",
              "value": "sonarqube-mcp",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-tool",
              "name": "toolName",
              "value": "search_sonar_issues_in_projects",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-project",
              "name": "projectKey",
              "value": "={{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.projectKey }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-data",
              "name": "result",
              "value": "={{ $json }}",
              "type": "object"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d7000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Format SonarQube Tool Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1040,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "opt-status",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "UNAVAILABLE_OPTIONAL",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "opt-server",
              "name": "mcpServer",
              "value": "sonarqube-mcp",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "opt-tool",
              "name": "toolName",
              "value": "search_sonar_issues_in_projects",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "opt-limitation",
              "name": "limitation",
              "value": "SonarQube MCP Server indisponivel, desligado (profile quality inativo) ou sonarProjectKey ausente. Prosseguir revisao com GitHub MCP e Gemini e registrar esta limitacao em limitations[].",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d7000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Format Optional SonarQube Unavailable",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1040,
        420
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When Executed by Another Workflow": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Validate Sonar Project Key",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Validate Sonar Project Key": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
